body:
Hello!

I am trying to initialize instantsearch with some pre checked filters. Basically I have a hierarchical menu with categories, and when the user visit for example /music/genre/rock i wanna make the "rock" value checked by default. I've tried this but with no luck: https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/830

My code looks like this:
```
var search = instantsearch({
	...
	searchParameters: {
		hierarchicalFacetsRefinements: {
			'music.genre': ['Rock']
		},
		facetingAfterDistinct: true,
		highlightPreTag: '__ais-highlight__',
		highlightPostTag: '__/ais-highlight__'
	}
});
```
and the hierarchical menu:
```
search.addWidget(
	instantsearch.widgets.hierarchicalMenu({
		container: '#genres',
		separator: ' > ',
		sortBy: ['count'],
		attributes: ['music_hierarchical.genre.lvl0', 'music_hierarchical.genre.lvl1', 'music_hierarchical.genre.lvl2'],
	})
);
```
Without this part everything works fine:
```
hierarchicalFacetsRefinements: {
	'music.genre': ['Rock']
},
```
But when I add that part I am getting:
**Cannot read property 'separator' of undefined at i._getHierarchicalFacetSeparator (instantsearch-preact.min.js?ver=1.2.0:4)**

Does anybody know what is going on here? Any help is very appreciated.
